42" uly="1198" lrx="538" lry="1236" /><zone xml:id="m-d735eeb8-d15a-487f-afca-ef47848b30e3" ulx="51" uly="1231" lrx="934" lry="1271" /><zone xml:id="m-43faea7b-5845-4eb3-b47f-33940fae48c0" ulx="43" uly="1262" lrx="934" lry="1300" /><zone xml:id="m-c7cee389-1a7d-42e7-aa11-95b5cf3e103a" ulx="42" uly="1291" lrx="774" lry="1331" /><zone xml:id="m-d36f7572-34bc-422f-8967-5137de8ff5ed" ulx="65" uly="1335" lrx="588" lry="1371" /><zone xml:id="m-28874195-b1a1-447c-8ea4-a8d5b7ceb4cd" ulx="67" uly="1367" lrx="649" lry="1407" /><zone xml:id="m-75584b3d-a7a2-431a-be7f-58cbef2e024c" ulx="366" uly="1418" lrx="612" lry="1452" /><zone xml:id="m-f3c5bb37-ee72-487b-94c6-6ee48d056568" ulx="43" uly="1457" lrx="935" lry="1495" /><zone xml:id="m-413165ce-b297-4832-8868-d0df80b597d5" ulx="51" uly="1482" lrx="933" lry="1520" /><zone xml:id="m-db2c26ad-ac6a-4cb1-979c-bd478ea87723" ulx="41" uly="1514" lrx="900" lry="1549" /><zone xml:id="m-4792e16c-e048-4846-b272-fb47e08435ae" ulx="64" uly="1553" lrx="794" lry="1595" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-b255518b-53ee-45d6-92a1-4832ef3c03e5" n="1791" facs="#m-61e9d677-5edf-49fb-8992-30383d96a164" /><div xml:id="m-db06bf0d-de08-41c4-af72-29e09f864254">
            <lg xml:id="m-d37b2e00-e964-4ea5-bc9b-d7a96488c067">
              <l xml:id="m-2aea473f-1947-4f1d-8d1b-fad3c1e2fbe4" facs="#m-7dba34c9-f761-49b7-adb3-4a64f59f9a28" label="ambiguous">Iuly 23.</l><l xml:id="m-99a5162d-0275-4ce3-85df-746ea157c2b4" facs="#m-b2413b96-8c70-404f-88a2-bb6148a7df84" label="ambiguous">1569</l><l xml:id="m-24916148-b1d1-4d4f-b5fb-13d90ee2d830" facs="#m-7866918f-b679-48f0-8fb9-50bb1089bf0e" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Petri Apostoli.  Petr. S.</l><l xml:id="m-90f80e99-e033-4168-bd95-29c251a6643c" facs="#m-e64b7048-4f05-4b09-9809-eaffef0ae95e" label="lyrics-like">(VArissimi: Senióres, qui in vobis miliámini igitur sub poténti manu</l><l xml:id="m-c2cc7aa0-3e89-41a6-834f-212b2307f5b9" facs="#m-6ad1f930-5fcc-4b7f-9767-db7ccc410e4b" label="lyrics-like">L sunt, óbsecro, consénior et te¬</l><l xml:id="m-733fbdb1-792c-4aeb-bb77-292716889393" facs="#m-4981e130-91ed-4935-86c4-5cbf03bcff10" label="lyrics-like">Dei, ut vos exáltet in témpore</l><l xml:id="m-86af6421-ef98-424d-8aeb-6565a8da6094" facs="#m-1e0ebc92-49ea-4e54-8a38-8e858ed97457" label="lyrics-like">visitatiónis: omnem sollicitúdinem</l><l xml:id="m-17afeceb-0c8f-436f-8649-a327f956f85b" facs="#m-732345c2-fe80-4840-9963-81ebc5ea10e2" label="lyrics-like">stis Christi passiónum: qui et ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-9cb31875-9c9b-4949-a304-48b369c03476" facs="#m-c447c6c8-37ca-4c8c-ae0c-b21f42238b68" label="lyrics-like">quae in futúro revelanda est, gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-3207053b-1e68-4d38-ad29-52c310b83f11" facs="#m-45faaf6d-87e7-4f93-b5f9-cca119077479" label="lyrics-like">vestram proiiciéntes in eum, quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-00b6f13d-052c-4cab-94d2-1467e3efa139" facs="#m-d6e8be89-728e-40b6-9696-dab6ae5da27c" label="lyrics-like">niam ipsi cura est de vobis. Sóbri</l><l xml:id="m-f80870c2-ef49-4128-8b8b-462253593728" facs="#m-11597395-71a8-4f94-af8f-4117167bf055" label="lyrics-like">riae communicátor : páscite qui in</l><l xml:id="m-c575dad4-09dc-466b-8393-9b93fee407a4" facs="#m-a512586b-ad0d-47ca-9e09-66680affa35b" label="lyrics-like">estóte, et vigilate: quia adversá¬</l><l xml:id="m-67addb6e-afec-4a65-bb5e-203ebfb80f64" facs="#m-0199fb03-dc5e-4f16-9aa1-dcf654d48245" label="lyrics-like">vobis est gregem Dei, providéntes</l><l xml:id="m-3c113ce9-f621-464e-905f-46a793fcf8ba" facs="#m-6ab958c9-0e9f-47a2-85cc-b5a4984ff6b7" label="lyrics-like">non coacte, sed spontânee secún¬</l><l xml:id="m-b447e7de-03de-475c-8972-06076cef1505" facs="#m-0e33efe4-5831-476f-be75-256561d04187" label="lyrics-like">rius vester diábolus, tamquam leo</l><l xml:id="m-515255c0-e29a-4e04-91d5-2fc7346008a2" facs="#m-7dc0c28b-7fd3-485d-8240-b315776e4446" label="ambiguous">dum Deum: neque turpis lucri</l><l xml:id="m-f902b4d1-339f-400a-a847-abff75842e55" facs="#m-4df9e413-0893-4c6a-9c90-9e3f8d1cfd83" label="lyrics-like">rúgiens círcuit, quaerens quem dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c048854-3f2d-42b7-a1e5-1e8a47921916" facs="#m-1407c728-9327-4bde-8bb2-59140a0b3762" label="lyrics-like">grátia, sed voluntárie: neque ut</l><l xml:id="m-6cd46f4a-f80b-4f07-91c5-793c56e6451a" facs="#m-4856827e-8586-4806-90fc-51ecffe68567" label="ambiguous">voret: cui resistite fortes in fide:</l><l xml:id="m-e9fd0703-baca-4f7e-bfcf-49b3aca92deb" facs="#m-349603c4-86de-48bc-8d04-d995268db06a" label="lyrics-like">dominántes in cleris, sed forma</l><l xml:id="m-87d44596-b8ac-4559-9b7b-61d950e82988" facs="#m-a9ab5ee2-ce14-4bdf-8d93-556c3f86d896" label="lyrics-like">sciéntes eámdem passiónem ei, quae</l><l xml:id="m-01b5c27e-894e-427d-ade9-2400fd244bc3" facs="#m-1ef7d188-332c-4dde-9266-a2d8884e413c" label="lyrics-like">facti gregis ex ánimo. Et cum</l><l xml:id="m-1a3f33cc-e63f-4397-82d1-41f970fae1f3" facs="#m-26d423f1-68ab-4076-a0b2-b9fd6e40b8f1" label="lyrics-like">in mundo est, vestrae fraternitáti</l><l xml:id="m-9487b256-fdb8-4d5c-9360-8f2193c6bd02" facs="#m-3fd64f8e-2aed-4eb2-8f87-a9ec7549d937" label="lyrics-like">apparúerit princeps pastórum, per¬</l><l xml:id="m-89b91f17-35fc-45f2-b9b5-67b8b73f603e" facs="#m-bf9961fb-e74d-4eaa-aca2-bc78260dac39" label="lyrics-like">fieri. Deus autem omnis grátiae,</l><l xml:id="m-dbbdd843-53ac-407c-ae60-7ee4646a3118" facs="#m-cd8e1ec9-cf22-4a0f-becd-1c305fce2c07" label="lyrics-like">cipiétis immarcescibilem glóriae</l><l xml:id="m-2a8cf892-357e-4f20-bf4e-8b7b1a995bb2" facs="#m-352bc9a2-b35a-4e74-8b33-954c3c039e21" label="lyrics-like">qui vocávit nos in aetérnam suam</l><l xml:id="m-b6271412-c03f-4544-b732-ca0637107e65" facs="#m-21ff25bf-2b96-482d-947e-f1fa9701472f" label="lyrics-like">corónam. Similiter adolescéntes,</l><l xml:id="m-63fe0870-dbd0-4139-8eb9-f8541af22814" facs="#m-7873553e-145c-436c-91d5-93a6ec2d5236" label="lyrics-like">glóriam in Christo Jesu, módicum</l><l xml:id="m-86c8654b-9c2f-44fd-b38b-489fd180fbb7" facs="#m-874b0c56-0f37-492b-ad22-82d8c3f105ae" label="lyrics-like">súbditi estóte senióribus. Omnes</l><l xml:id="m-5bf7e995-9b1c-4981-b77a-9e38daa54987" facs="#m-3275e851-8631-4225-bd19-460aeaebd5d4" label="lyrics-like">passos ipse perficiet, confirmábit,</l><l xml:id="m-04bcf0bf-4c8e-40dc-8374-897afeacb527" facs="#m-febc7331-84ea-456b-bee2-83cbab4b61b0" label="lyrics-like">autem ínvicem humilitátem insi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d3a4f8e4-e272-4edb-a596-9ebe1f3c5fad" facs="#m-61241384-032f-43ae-8a34-d21de2d49c88" label="lyrics-like">solidabitque. Ipsi glória et impé¬</l><l xml:id="m-700663c8-2f90-489d-95f9-d39e0b66943d" facs="#m-c718b8af-c4da-483e-87d9-3ba00b01b2f0" label="lyrics-like">nuáte: quia Deus supérbis resistit,</l><l xml:id="m-b27b60b2-bb88-4453-badc-a47559fbf4a6" facs="#m-998e9d5e-5349-4ea6-86ce-109ab9fedd3d" label="lyrics-like">rium in saécula saeculórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-95c5b407-52f2-44c1-a709-930d085e6fba" facs="#m-1d14121a-d304-4882-8da3-65b8ee1dcc0c" label="lyrics-like">humilibus autem dat grátiam. Hu¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf3a46b1-5eff-4fb6-a320-ec438fc89aa2" facs="#m-8d9456a4-63f9-42b6-a103-bc777d8d8cc8" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Invéni Dávid. D. 1130. Allelúia, alleluia. V. Jurávit Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-086ba122-6da2-4ab5-8aeb-171228deaa53" facs="#m-2d10cea2-f7ba-42e7-9bb3-67792b5f0beb" label="ambiguous">nus. p. 1187.</l><l xml:id="m-a3544097-207a-4eb2-89c8-86b19e3ab49b" facs="#m-c6c43b6d-6912-4033-9d3b-a0b24740c20e" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Lucam. Luc. 22. c.</l><l xml:id="m-a9b7821e-a648-4dc5-bd98-429eb9b68a95" facs="#m-3aebbd16-ba79-4b26-8b44-18167118ab4a" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Facta est con-Nonne qui recúmbit? Ego autem</l><l xml:id="m-fa1f9120-e31b-4038-9e5b-fffd7f94fa7d" facs="#m-c2dc3786-c43c-4d76-b44e-160d37b1a68b" label="lyrics-like">L téntio inter discípulos, quis eo¬</l><l xml:id="m-add390a8-7893-4c15-a571-647be074e36b" facs="#m-518be710-cad4-4474-b4b1-7cf54e337bff" label="lyrics-like">in médio vestrum sum, sicut qui</l><l xml:id="m-4153bb8e-6f7d-4a7e-85a1-380685ec3cf6" facs="#m-e0617747-3a5c-4b62-9958-89858358d214" label="lyrics-like">rum viderétur essé major. Dixit</l><l xml:id="m-cc563b45-0feb-4189-a637-4b06e96b4db1" facs="#m-2e1d6139-01ec-4eee-b142-73370950ebf3" label="lyrics-like">minístrat. Vos autem estis, qui per¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c56d3d1-7fcc-43f3-af0b-423d9d6cd4fc" facs="#m-924928f2-3af4-45ca-a555-5ce6c20f0787" label="lyrics-like">mansístis mecum in tentatiónibus</l><l xml:id="m-91660716-7ae6-4006-ad8d-ee7a3f4e135b" facs="#m-444e3f1d-7546-45c0-a5ab-f7ab3c57fd26" label="lyrics-like">autem eis Jesus: Reges géntium</l><l xml:id="m-874b03cb-fef2-461a-9018-25a829194694" facs="#m-feaaa378-e633-4a45-9e09-52970fbc671f" label="lyrics-like">meis: et ego dispóno vobis, sicut</l><l xml:id="m-0685c659-920f-4d25-b47e-7f5642abed51" facs="#m-fed21b7f-a5e9-4efa-a6f6-c652b56ca60e" label="lyrics-like">dominántur eórum; et qui pote¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ae0ed6b-c718-44ad-96d8-d1dd541ee225" facs="#m-ffc7024e-b381-420d-91f2-2a9d2ac3433f" label="lyrics-like">dispósuit mihi Pater meus regnum,</l><l xml:id="m-c1af08ae-3481-458a-a831-62ce35be2889" facs="#m-5dc9bb42-fd0a-43e6-8c76-215fd94432dd" label="lyrics-like">státem habent super eos, benéfici</l><l xml:id="m-683851e6-47e5-4c6d-aece-b9b970602d40" facs="#m-e3e1e0ac-3561-4273-936c-ebd76caced4c" label="lyrics-like">ut edátis et bibátis super mensam</l><l xml:id="m-625af608-9946-41d2-ba75-a2fdc0d7547e" facs="#m-c7930915-beba-41a9-920b-a3e58ab6e23d" label="lyrics-like">vocántur. Vos autem non sic: sed</l><l xml:id="m-c73c64d0-1c02-4283-9a6e-0c8cb4f8643f" facs="#m-1c726012-0f4f-49f8-93bf-a30dc890bc9e" label="ambiguous">qui major est in vobis, fiat sicut</l><l xml:id="m-5bf2f420-6e85-4944-b9e4-a248acf3158d" facs="#m-c7e3c087-aa39-45de-95dd-62ad3e8b1106" label="lyrics-like">meam in regno meo: et sedeátis</l><l xml:id="m-6a1f0e05-22fa-463d-8957-22090ca848fa" facs="#m-9cbda1f2-e778-4ce6-86d8-e991e4701214" label="lyrics-like">super thronos, judicantes duódecim</l><l xml:id="m-dfe1d39c-a594-45da-956f-14b753946369" facs="#m-ec9ed348-c866-4994-902a-3366b61b5ecf" label="lyrics-like">minor: et qui praecéssor est, sicut</l><l xml:id="m-476d8cfc-e6f2-4475-81da-809454862331" facs="#m-5052ec66-788b-4e90-a289-a7ecf45eac77" label="lyrics-like">ministrátor. Nam quis major est,</l><l xml:id="m-3171ce38-5a8f-45a0-af63-f3a82f0a11c7" facs="#m-62a3bddb-5109-4c22-acda-1baa5a0a1917" label="ambiguous">tribus Israel.</l><l xml:id="m-e5896ecc-17dc-45de-996a-9280c5c87f34" facs="#m-6effd4a6-2613-4789-a6c8-b8a9dda3e119" label="lyrics-like">qui recúmbit, an qui minístrat?</l><l xml:id="m-f1ea970a-a04c-40cf-8400-f1791d965a6c" facs="#m-87505e06-f216-4012-868d-4e4ac6023486" label="lyrics-like">offertory. Véritas méa. p. 1203.</l><l xml:id="m-35f717f4-cff9-4b08-9ee8-121e3374de10" facs="#m-8f183a20-7a6b-4576-a195-509f87ae8029" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-40d6282e-2026-41b0-b7ec-4bb04865f52c" facs="#m-d735eeb8-d15a-487f-afca-ef47848b30e3" label="lyrics-like">DEspice Dómine propitius super [náris commemoratióne deférimus,</l><l xml:id="m-b7688b0e-eb7c-4c2a-b182-800608c8490e" facs="#m-43faea7b-5845-4eb3-b47f-33940fae48c0" label="lyrics-like">It haec múnera, quae pro beátil et pro nostris offensiónibus immo¬</l><l xml:id="m-db66eee5-0776-440b-a479-be35ce998c6d" facs="#m-c7cee389-1a7d-42e7-aa11-95b5cf3e103a" label="lyrics-like">Sacerdótis et Mártyris tui Apolli-llámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9408680b-7a13-4506-a8a5-1ccf26ae52b1" facs="#m-d36f7572-34bc-422f-8967-5137de8ff5ed" label="text-like">of St. Liborius. Secret. Sancti tui. p. 1185.</l><l xml:id="m-5e56a9e9-d758-41df-b254-f487989d27fc" facs="#m-28874195-b1a1-447c-8ea4-a8d5b7ceb4cd" label="lyrics-like">Communion. Dómine quinque talénta. D. 1311.</l><l xml:id="m-e37394d7-13a2-4bd7-9464-9cf75eb2845f" facs="#m-75584b3d-a7a2-431a-be7f-58cbef2e024c" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-2349452b-436d-4ccd-aa00-37885abcdf98" facs="#m-f3c5bb37-ee72-487b-94c6-6ee48d056568" label="lyrics-like">UA sancta suméntes, quaésu- sídia: quia non désinis propitius</l><l xml:id="m-afbd0a63-2731-4c4a-8739-148d44942908" facs="#m-413165ce-b297-4832-8868-d0df80b597d5" label="lyrics-like">I mus Dómine, ut beáti Apolli-lintuéri, quos tálibus auxílis con¬</l><l xml:id="m-2336a6bf-3d59-4d81-bc7e-cf66afaddd42" facs="#m-db2c26ad-ac6a-4cb1-979c-bd478ea87723" label="lyrics-like">náris nos fóveant continuáta prae-l césseris adjuvári. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-fe2fef4d-b5a3-4ce6-b864-b7b74ad7201f" facs="#m-4792e16c-e048-4846-b272-fb47e08435ae" label="lyrics-like">of St. Liborius. Postcommunion. Praesta quaésumus. p. 1185.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>